ed. With the intended refinancing, hep global GmbH aims to strengthen its capital structure, increase financial flexibility and create the conditions for further growth. In particular, the successful implementation of a long-term financing solution is intended to provide the basis for the repayment of the green bond 2021/2027, which matures in November 2027."]},{"type":"p","children":["Due to the ongoing pressure on margins and the delays in planned project transactions as a result of the targeted and still pending refinancing of the 2021/2027 bond, which was successfully extended in spring 2026, the company now expects consolidated revenues of EUR 40 million to EUR 45 million (previously: EUR 45 million to EUR 55 million) and earnings before interest and taxes (EBIT) of EUR 1 million to EUR 5 million (previously: EUR 0 million to EUR 10 million)."]},{"type":"p","children":["Notifying Person:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Georg von Eichendorff Strachwitz"]},{"type":"p","children":["hep global GmbH"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Press contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Evelyn Kilinc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Römerstraße 3"]},{"type":"p","children":["74363 Güglingen"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel.: +49 7135 93446-759"]},{"type":"p","children":["E-Mail: presse@hep.global"]},{"type":"p","children":["www.hepsolar.com"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Investor contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Christian Hamann"]},{"type":"p","children":["Römerstraße 3"]},{"type":"p","children":["74363 Güglingen"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel.: +49 7135 93446-0"]},{"type":"p","children":["E-Mail: greenbond@hep.global"]},{"type":"p","children":["www.hepsolar.com"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Financial press contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Frank Ostermair, Linh Chung"]},{"type":"p","children":["IR4value GmbH"]},{"type":"p","children":["Leopoldstraße 31"]},{"type":"p","children":["80802 München"]},{"type":"p","chil